---
import Diagram from './Diagram.astro';
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/interview-after-grading-gates-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/interview-after-grading-gates-dark.svg?raw';
---

<Diagram
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  maxWidth={460}
  caption="The grading pass as it runs now. A quote the script can't find never reaches the page."
>
  The grading pass first checks that a transcript or hand notes are on the page. If not, it stops and asks for them. If
  so, it picks one or two quotes per dimension, and a script checks each quote against the transcript. A quote the
  script can't find is dropped. Each dimension is then scored one to four, or N/A when no checked quote backs it. The
  result block is appended to the page and the pass stops for review. I set the fields and the status.
</Diagram>
